            <div class="user-detail-field"><span>แพ็กเกจ</span><strong id="detail-package-name">-</strong></div>
            <div class="user-detail-field"><span>ที่มาแพ็กเกจ</span><strong id="detail-source-channel">-</strong></div>
            <div class="user-detail-field"><span>หมดอายุแพ็กเกจ</span><strong id="detail-package-end-at">-</strong></div>
            <div class="user-detail-field"><span>ยืนยันเมื่อ</span><strong id="detail-identity-verified-at">-</strong></div>
            <div class="user-detail-field"><span>สมัครเมื่อ</span><strong id="detail-created-at">-</strong></div>
            <div class="user-detail-field"><span>เข้าใช้ล่าสุด</span><strong id="detail-last-login-at">-</strong></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="user-detail-section">
          <div class="user-detail-section-head">
            <span class="user-detail-section-icon is-bank" aria-hidden="true">
